+   * [testInfo.outputDir](https://playwright.dev/docs/api/class-testinfo#test-info-output-dir) and
+   * [testInfo.outputPath(...pathSegments)](https://playwright.dev/docs/api/class-testinfo#test-info-output-path).
+   *
